# `unsorted` is last on purpose: it is where a skill waits, not what a skill is.
# Everything the keyword rules cannot place lands there instead of being pushed
# into `agents`, which was the old residual and was a lie -- a skill about LaTeX
# that matched nothing is not an agents skill, it is an unfiled one, and calling
# it agents both hid it and made that shelf untrustworthy.
